Description: List the functions the global menu patches add in the symbols file.
 keep-keyboard-focus.patch, kde-appmenu.patch, shell-shows-menubar.patch and watched-modifiers.patch add
 functions to libmutter-18, and Ubuntu builds with DPKG_GENSYMBOLS_CHECK_LEVEL=4, which fails the build on any
 exported symbol the symbols file does not list.
Author: Mitar
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
--- a/debian/libmutter-18-0.symbols
+++ b/debian/libmutter-18-0.symbols
@@ -238,7 +238,10 @@
  meta_display_lookup_stack_id@Base 43.0
  meta_display_remove_keybinding@Base 43.0
  meta_display_request_pad_osd@Base 43.0
+ meta_display_set_grab_keeps_keyboard_focus@Base 50.1
  meta_display_set_input_focus@Base 43.0
+ meta_display_set_shell_shows_menubar@Base 50.1
+ meta_display_set_watched_modifiers@Base 50.1
  meta_display_sort_windows_by_stacking@Base 43.0
  meta_display_ungrab_accelerator@Base 43.0
  meta_display_unset_input_focus@Base 43.0
@@ -848,6 +851,8 @@
  meta_window_get_client_content_rect@Base 47.3
  meta_window_get_client_type@Base 43.0
  meta_window_get_compositor_private@Base 43.0
+ meta_window_get_dbus_appmenu_object_path@Base 50.1
+ meta_window_get_dbus_appmenu_service_name@Base 50.1
  meta_window_get_description@Base 43.0
  meta_window_get_display@Base 43.0
  meta_window_get_frame_rect@Base 43.0
